// Link graph of one leaf -> the bytes of its file before compression: the three parts one after the other (each
// knows its own length; splitTile takes them apart). Nodes are stored in Morton order, the shared ones first, and
// links in the order of their start node, so the decoded graph is numbered differently from L.
// A part: "CSO1" | u8 TILE_VERSION | u8 part (0 base, 1 elevation, 2 derived) | u z, x, y, nodes, shared, links,
// streams | u length per stream | the streams. A reader steps over streams it does not know (a later addition).
